  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "这位104岁的老太太，应该是中国最后一位贵族小姐，汪曾祺、杨振宁是她在西南联大的同学，沈从文、巴金是她一生的知己，小说《呼啸山庄》就是她翻译成中文的，她叫杨苡，文坛的一位祖母，更是一位永远的小女生。#读书 #文学 #杨苡",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 203.766667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你能想象吗？这位一百零四岁的老太太，应该是中国最后一位贵族小姐。汪曾祺、杨振宁是她在西南联大的同学。沈从文、巴金是她一生的知己。她说，呼啸山庄就是她翻译成中文的。她的丈夫赵瑞虹则翻译了小说红与黑，她的哥哥杨献义和大嫂、戴乃蝶被认为是翻译了整个中国的人。时代不是她的人生背景，她的人生就是时代本身。他的同辈人在世的已所剩无几，因为长寿，他几乎看到了所有人的结局。他叫杨毅文坛的一位祖母，杨毅先生的家在南京大学附近门口的芭蕉树苍翠欲滴。杨先生虽然一百零四岁了也依然是小女生，有人拜访时他都会描眉毛抹口红，他的思维非常敏捷，说起话来中气十足，根本不像一位一百多岁的老人，而且记忆力非常强，一个世纪前的往事连细节都记得很很清楚。杨毅十六岁就和巴金成了至交，后来认识了巴金的哥哥李瑶玲，他叫他大理先生，大力先生很喜欢音乐，有一段日子，每到下午，杨颖就会把房间里对接的窗户打开在留声机上，大声的放唱片。这是一个小女生和大李先生的秘密，大理先生每天都会经过这里，那音乐就是放给他听的。杨毅后来考上了西南联大，他与大理先生相约昆明见，但最终大李先生并没有出现。杨毅先生回忆往事时说，大李先生是不是他的初恋他不懂，但他曾经是他心里的一盏灯。在沈从文的建议下，杨颖就读了西南联大外文系，她的室友杜志理后来嫁给了杨振宁，而杨乙则被学长赵瑞虹追求。一九四零年，在那个战火纷飞的年代里，两人结婚。在特殊时期，哥哥杨现义被捕入狱，杨椅则一次次挨批斗，遭拳脚，甚至被当众扇耳光。罪名呢现在看起来简直荒唐，说他翻译的呼啸山庄宣扬了爱情至上在杨毅先生的身上。我明白了，什么叫做见过世面，那就是见过最好的，也承受过最坏的。他说，杨家人最骄傲的是在任何突然来临的事故，甚至劫难出现时，都能做到猝然临之而不精，无故加之而不怒。或许正因为此，杨家人有着惊人的长寿基因，母亲享年九十六岁。哥哥活到九十四岁，姐姐活到一百零二岁。杨毅先生今年出版了一本自传，回忆他百年的往事，让我非常感动的是，他依然为我在书上签下了名。我问他，有哪些话想对当下的年轻人说，他引用了基督山伯爵里的一句话，人类的全部智慧就包含在这两个词当中等待与希望。我似乎听懂了他的话语，冬天又要来了，但这片土地本来就不可能是四季如春的，与其祈求春天永远不走，不如想一想怎样去面对风和雨雪。嗯嗯。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00001",
      "start_ms": 370,
      "end_ms": 1370,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1530,
      "end_ms": 3330,
      "text": "这位一百零四岁的老太太，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3490,
      "end_ms": 5670,
      "text": "应该是中国最后一位贵族小姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 9550,
      "text": "汪曾祺、杨振宁是她在西南联大的同学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9950,
      "end_ms": 12310,
      "text": "沈从文、巴金是她一生的知己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13090,
      "end_ms": 13530,
      "text": "她说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 15730,
      "text": "呼啸山庄就是她翻译成中文的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15930,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "她的丈夫赵瑞虹则翻译了小说红与黑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18810,
      "end_ms": 23410,
      "text": "她的哥哥杨献义和大嫂、戴乃蝶被认为是翻译了整个中国的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24050,
      "end_ms": 25770,
      "text": "时代不是她的人生背景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26050,
      "end_ms": 28050,
      "text": "她的人生就是时代本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28650,
      "end_ms": 31260,
      "text": "他的同辈人在世的已所剩无几，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31600,
      "end_ms": 32380,
      "text": "因为长寿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32660,
      "end_ms": 34720,
      "text": "他几乎看到了所有人的结局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35300,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "他叫杨毅文坛的一位祖母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38900,
      "end_ms": 43520,
      "text": "杨毅先生的家在南京大学附近门口的芭蕉树苍翠欲滴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43840,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "杨先生虽然一百零四岁了也依然是小女生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47600,
      "end_ms": 50340,
      "text": "有人拜访时他都会描眉毛抹口红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50680,
      "end_ms": 52080,
      "text": "他的思维非常敏捷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52300,
      "end_ms": 53820,
      "text": "说起话来中气十足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53860,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "根本不像一位一百多岁的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56040,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "而且记忆力非常强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 60765,
      "text": "一个世纪前的往事连细节都记得很很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61460,
      "end_ms": 63755,
      "text": "杨毅十六岁就和巴金成了至交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64130,
      "end_ms": 66085,
      "text": "后来认识了巴金的哥哥李瑶玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66500,
      "end_ms": 67835,
      "text": "他叫他大理先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68310,
      "end_ms": 69845,
      "text": "大力先生很喜欢音乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00028",
      "start_ms": 70250,
      "end_ms": 70990,
      "text": "有一段日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70990,
      "end_ms": 71695,
      "text": "每到下午，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71920,
      "end_ms": 75630,
      "text": "杨颖就会把房间里对接的窗户打开在留声机上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75650,
      "end_ms": 76785,
      "text": "大声的放唱片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77240,
      "end_ms": 79535,
      "text": "这是一个小女生和大李先生的秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79860,
      "end_ms": 81655,
      "text": "大理先生每天都会经过这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00034",
      "start_ms": 81890,
      "end_ms": 83905,
      "text": "那音乐就是放给他听的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84730,
      "end_ms": 86410,
      "text": "杨毅后来考上了西南联大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00036",
      "start_ms": 86610,
      "end_ms": 88615,
      "text": "他与大理先生相约昆明见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00037",
      "start_ms": 88890,
      "end_ms": 90785,
      "text": "但最终大李先生并没有出现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91240,
      "end_ms": 92935,
      "text": "杨毅先生回忆往事时说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00039",
      "start_ms": 93270,
      "end_ms": 95975,
      "text": "大李先生是不是他的初恋他不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00040",
      "start_ms": 96330,
      "end_ms": 98285,
      "text": "但他曾经是他心里的一盏灯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99230,
      "end_ms": 100525,
      "text": "在沈从文的建议下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00042",
      "start_ms": 100790,
      "end_ms": 102735,
      "text": "杨颖就读了西南联大外文系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103050,
      "end_ms": 105425,
      "text": "她的室友杜志理后来嫁给了杨振宁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105720,
      "end_ms": 108120,
      "text": "而杨乙则被学长赵瑞虹追求。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00045",
      "start_ms": 108320,
      "end_ms": 109295,
      "text": "一九四零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00046",
      "start_ms": 109580,
      "end_ms": 111285,
      "text": "在那个战火纷飞的年代里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00047",
      "start_ms": 111560,
      "end_ms": 112325,
      "text": "两人结婚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00048",
      "start_ms": 113240,
      "end_ms": 114200,
      "text": "在特殊时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00049",
      "start_ms": 114280,
      "end_ms": 115865,
      "text": "哥哥杨现义被捕入狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00050",
      "start_ms": 116210,
      "end_ms": 118150,
      "text": "杨椅则一次次挨批斗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00051",
      "start_ms": 118150,
      "end_ms": 118875,
      "text": "遭拳脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00052",
      "start_ms": 119190,
      "end_ms": 120490,
      "text": "甚至被当众扇耳光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00053",
      "start_ms": 120890,
      "end_ms": 123115,
      "text": "罪名呢现在看起来简直荒唐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00054",
      "start_ms": 123430,
      "end_ms": 128280,
      "text": "说他翻译的呼啸山庄宣扬了爱情至上在杨毅先生的身上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00055",
      "start_ms": 128280,
      "end_ms": 128860,
      "text": "我明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00056",
      "start_ms": 128860,
      "end_ms": 130275,
      "text": "什么叫做见过世面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00057",
      "start_ms": 130650,
      "end_ms": 132125,
      "text": "那就是见过最好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00058",
      "start_ms": 132340,
      "end_ms": 133725,
      "text": "也承受过最坏的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00059",
      "start_ms": 134080,
      "end_ms": 134465,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00060",
      "start_ms": 134760,
      "end_ms": 138180,
      "text": "杨家人最骄傲的是在任何突然来临的事故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00061",
      "start_ms": 138180,
      "end_ms": 139635,
      "text": "甚至劫难出现时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00062",
      "start_ms": 139870,
      "end_ms": 142390,
      "text": "都能做到猝然临之而不精，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00063",
      "start_ms": 142590,
      "end_ms": 143985,
      "text": "无故加之而不怒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00064",
      "start_ms": 144450,
      "end_ms": 145365,
      "text": "或许正因为此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00065",
      "start_ms": 145630,
      "end_ms": 147705,
      "text": "杨家人有着惊人的长寿基因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00066",
      "start_ms": 148120,
      "end_ms": 149635,
      "text": "母亲享年九十六岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00067",
      "start_ms": 149980,
      "end_ms": 151275,
      "text": "哥哥活到九十四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00068",
      "start_ms": 151650,
      "end_ms": 153225,
      "text": "姐姐活到一百零二岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00069",
      "start_ms": 153990,
      "end_ms": 155890,
      "text": "杨毅先生今年出版了一本自传，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00070",
      "start_ms": 156130,
      "end_ms": 157754,
      "text": "回忆他百年的往事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00071",
      "start_ms": 158130,
      "end_ms": 159390,
      "text": "让我非常感动的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00072",
      "start_ms": 159530,
      "end_ms": 161905,
      "text": "他依然为我在书上签下了名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00073",
      "start_ms": 162450,
      "end_ms": 162850,
      "text": "我问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00074",
      "start_ms": 162850,
      "end_ms": 165005,
      "text": "有哪些话想对当下的年轻人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00075",
      "start_ms": 165270,
      "end_ms": 167375,
      "text": "他引用了基督山伯爵里的一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00076",
      "start_ms": 167870,
      "end_ms": 172755,
      "text": "人类的全部智慧就包含在这两个词当中等待与希望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00077",
      "start_ms": 173630,
      "end_ms": 175115,
      "text": "我似乎听懂了他的话语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00078",
      "start_ms": 175730,
      "end_ms": 176665,
      "text": "冬天又要来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00079",
      "start_ms": 176930,
      "end_ms": 180175,
      "text": "但这片土地本来就不可能是四季如春的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00080",
      "start_ms": 180550,
      "end_ms": 182605,
      "text": "与其祈求春天永远不走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00081",
      "start_ms": 182920,
      "end_ms": 185505,
      "text": "不如想一想怎样去面对风和雨雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c948e1f6874a7d75_s00082",
      "start_ms": 189130,
      "end_ms": 189800,
      "text": "嗯嗯。"
    }
  ],
